olicitação. ESTAMOS ANSIOSOS PARA ATENDER SUA MOTO. OBRIGADO! Equipe GW Motopeças.', 118.0, 103.84, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Spare Parts for Motorcycles > Side Mirrors', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/51bea1b091e58348255d756f21263242', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F502527769%2F16570316684', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
