cheio: Luz amarela <', 1532.8, 1532.8, NULL, 'Computers & Accessories > Office Equipment > Paper Shredders', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rbn7-m5vj4cdh7cyz5e', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F427153374%2F23093685203', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
